  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Step 2",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&{}-1\\le\\sin4\\theta\\le1\\Rightarrow-17\\le f\\le17\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Answer",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\text{ (c) $-$17.}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": []
  }
 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "**Max = a + |b|, Min = a − |b|.** The numbers inside the bracket (c and d) never change the height.",
  "**Period = 2π ÷ c.** A bigger c squeezes the wave sideways.",
  "A **negative b** flips the wave upside-down, but the highest and lowest values stay a ± |b|."
 ],
